# Calm lists in Command Center

Every list page (Rules, Skills, Logging, Memory, and any new list) uses the shared calm list so all pages look the same.

## Required

- Rows are `ItemRow variant="graph"` inside `ItemList className="calm-list"` (Memory uses `memory-vault-list`, which shares the same CSS).
- Grouped lists use `ItemGroupHeader` per group; Rules and Skills use `PolicyCalmList`.
- Row text: title, one quiet subtitle line, meta on the right. Row controls (toggle, checkbox, actions) sit in `aside` and appear on hover or when active.
- Badges follow [[outline-badges]].

## Forbidden

- Data tables (`<table>`, `DataTable`) for list pages.
- Page-specific row styles that diverge from the calm list.

